  'Per-protocol signal gate (#718) — the Signals pre-trade gate resolves signals.gate.<protocolId> override (global_setting, 60s cache) → protocol trading style (scalp 75 / speed 80 / day-trade 65 / swing 55 / position 45) → 65 default; the gate blocker message reports the effective threshold. Missing-data group neutrality verified.',
