  '2026-09-10: Bar coverage missing for OIL/BTC/INDEX symbols — USOIL, UKOIL, NATGAS, BTCUSD and TECH100 return NO rows in `marketbar` (BTCUSD last bar 2026-07-18), so an enabled oil/btc protocol still could not score. OIL and BTC protocols are additionally `active=false`. (VIX is NOT affected: 5,430 bars, newest today.)',
