  '2026-09-13: Documentation triage — the repo held 136 .md files (~70% of ALL project docs) and is about to become public. Added documentation-standards.instructions.md (categories A–G, two-root rule, standard header, never-delete-reasoning lifecycle) and moved working / handoff / theory / commercial docs to the central docs store; 136 → 61 files. ⚠️ Handoffs now live OUTSIDE the repo (docs/handoff/ removed; .github/handoffs/ still fails the build). validate-agent-docs.cjs gained check 7 (docs missing a date/status header — reported) and check 8 (the handoff rule must still name the central store).',
    '2026-09-15: The notice-migration counter is a FLOOR, not a total — it measures `.message` extraction only, so an error STRING passed as a child is invisible to it (the speed scanner\u2019s `scanError` was rendered in three pages and counted nowhere). Nine raw renders remain in four files; the real total is not knowable from the metric.',
